	•	AI Model Architecture: Artificial Neural Networks (ANN, MLP, NN)
	•	Algorithm Name: International Heart Transplantation Survival Algorithm (IHTSA); comparator IMPACT
	•	Input Variables (Data Modality): Tabular (EMR/Clinical data), Donor metrics
	•	Comparator / Standard of Care: Linear Risk Score (e.g., LAS, EuroSCORE)
	•	Validation Method: External Validation (Temporal)
