	•	Training Size (N): 22263
	•	Test Size (N): 5597
	•	Section 4 Comments/Quotes: The derivation cohort contained 22,263 transplants and the test cohort 5,597. The tables repeatedly report “N, number of transplants with non-missing values,” which indicates analysis on available cases rather than explicit imputation, so complete-case style handling is the best fit. No class-imbalance strategy or preprocessing/normalization details were reported. A web calculator for IHTSA is mentioned, but no code repository or released weights were identified, so code availability is marked Other.  ￼

